    "Forced override for ALL native subagents. Any backend model of the Codex catalog is allowed, optionally with ‘-fast’; ‘auto’ = latest model (currently %@); unknown values safely fall back to the latest model. Recommendation: leave empty and let GPT subagents be chosen via the agent type “gpt”.": {
